@page
@model CodeOfConductModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "The Khurshid Institute - Code of Conduct";
}

<div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
    <h1>Code of Conduct</h1>
</div>

<div>
    <p>
        All employees, contractors, and partners engaged in work on behalf of The Khurshid Institute are expected to abide by the following code of conduct.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Commitment to the Public Interest</p>
            <p>
                We conduct our work in a manner that prioritizes the public good, community well-being, and public trust. 
                Decisions are guided by the long-term interests of residents and stakeholders served by our public-sector clients.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Integrity and Professionalism</p>
            <p>
                We act with honesty, fairness, and professionalism in all interactions. 
                We provide accurate information, avoid misrepresentation, and clearly communicate risks, limitations, and assumptions.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Accountability and Transparency</p>
            <p>
                We take responsibility for our work and decisions. 
                Documentation, reporting, and communications are conducted in a manner that supports transparency, auditability, and public accountability.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Respectful and Inclusive Conduct</p>
            <p>
                We foster a respectful, inclusive, and harassment-free environment. 
                We value diversity and ensure that our conduct aligns with principles of equity, inclusion, and accessibility.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Confidentiality and Data Protection</p>
            <p>
                We safeguard confidential information and personal data in accordance with applicable Canadian legislation, including privacy and access-to-information requirements. 
                Information is used only for authorized purposes.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Conflict of Interest</p>
            <p>
                We avoid actual, potential, or perceived conflicts of interest. 
                Any conflicts are disclosed promptly and managed in accordance with ethical best practices.
            </p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Compliance with Laws and Policies</p>
            <p>
                We comply with all applicable federal, provincial, and municipal laws, regulations, and client policies, including procurement, privacy, accessibility, and ethical standards.
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>